  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida Humanitarian Framework Agreement (HFA) VI - Year 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRC delivers lifesaving humanitarian assistance across 14 crisis-affected countries under a Programme-Based Approach partnership with Sida. This represents Year 1 (April 2026 &#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x201c; March 2027) of the Humanitarian Framework Agreement VI and targets displaced populations, women and girls, and other vulnerable groups through integrated health, protection, food security, cash, education, and WASH programming. The partnership also funds NGO coordination mechanisms and a Rapid Response Mechanism for acute global emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
